    "title": "Mahjong Solitaire - Tile Match",
    "description": "Welcome to the most classic Mahjong game! We have elaborately designed this game so that you can enjoy it in leisure time. Match all the same mahjong tiles on the field and eliminate them to complete the level!\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- Classic Mahjong gameplay, easy to learn, suitable for all ages\r\n- Elaborately designed mahjong tiles and background, visual enjoyment\r\n- More than 1,000 interesting chessboard layouts\r\n- Powerful boosters to help you successfully complete the level\r\n- Cool boosters animation, give you a comfortable game experience\r\n- Daily challenge\r\n- Automatic scaling\r\n- Personal statistics data\r\n- No network needed! Play offline anytime, anywhere\r\n\r\nWhether you are a mahjong enthusiast or not, we believe this game can bring you infinite fun. Come and download and challenge your game skills!\r\n\r\nIf you have any suggestion, please feel free to contact us: zhongjunwei365@gmail.com.",
